<title>ESTONIA: SOCCER-ESTONIA V SWEDEN TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ESTONIA V SWEDEN TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the World Cup European zone group four qualifier between Estonia and Sweden on Sunday:</p>
<p>Estonia - 1-Mart Poom, 2-Marek Lemsalu, 3-Urmas Kirs, 4-Sergei Hohlov-Simson, 5-Janek Meet, 6-Liivo Leetma, 7-Meelis Rooba, 8-Andres Oper, 9-Marko Kristal, 10-Martin Reim, 11-Indrek Zelinksi.</p>
<p>Sweden: 1-Magnus Hedman, 2-Roland Nilsson, 3-Patrik Andersson, 4-Joachim Bjorklund, 5-Gary Sundgren, 6-Hakan Mild, 7-Par Zetterberg, 8-Andreas Andersson, 9-Jonas Thern, 10-Martin Dahlin, 11-Kennet Andersson.</p>
</text>
